+/*
+ * LINUX64 (xnulinux): when XNU is hosted inside Linux by xnu.ko, xnu.ko sets
+ * linux64_hook before calling arm_init. Each stage calls into the host, which
+ * may resume XNU or end the run. The call is a plain blr: the hook is host
